# Spotify Web API credentials (PKCE flow — no client secret needed)
# Get a Client ID by creating an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# The redirect URI MUST match exactly what is registered in the dashboard.
# Spotify requires explicit loopback IPs for HTTP — do NOT use 'localhost'.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/spotify/auth/callback
